{"_data": [{"contents": [{"content": "Reaching an Agreement", "type": "lesson_name"}, {"content": "Group Planning the Event", "type": "unit_name"}, {"content": 4, "type": "position"}, {"content": "stub", "type": "origin"}, {"content": 14, "type": "lesson"}, {"content": "B1.2", "type": "level"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"content": "false", "type": "test"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Accurately use information about common technology in communicative situations.", "type": "primary"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_1"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_2"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_3"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_4"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_5"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_6"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_7"}, {"content": "Understands important and some specific information and aspects of attitude and intention using a range of appropriate language, in written or spoken documents or presentations.", "type": "secondary_8"}], "type": "objectives"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04re1img01.jpg", "type": "background_image"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Responding Politely to Questions ", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It is normal to be asked questions from friends, coworkers, and family. When responding to these questions, it is important to be polite. Here are some phrases to politely respond to questions. ", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saying \u201cYes\u201d Politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Saying \u201cNo\u201d Politely\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" <span class=\\\"italic\\\"><li>Yes, that's a good start / idea.</li><li>Certainly.</li><li>It's definitely a good / great idea.</li><li>Perfect.</li></span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm OK for now. </span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I regret to inform you that</span> + clause</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm afraid</span> + clause</li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">No, thanks.</span></li><li><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Not sure, but</span> \u2026 + clause </li>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "A: Hey, do you want some tea? <br/>B: <span class=\"strong\">No, thanks. I'm OK for now.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A: Do you have a time in mind? <br/>B: <span class=\"strong\">I'm afraid</span> not. How about next week? <br/>A: <span class=\"strong\">Perfect.</span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A: Let's have the event next week. <br/> B: <span class=\"strong\">Certainly. </span>", "type": "example"}, {"content": "A: Why don't we start by choosing a venue? <br/>B: <span class=\"strong\">That's a good start. </span>", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Weak Form in Questions", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "English is different from many languages because it is a stress-time language. This means that some words are stressed and others are not when speaking.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "Content words (nouns, verbs, adjectives,  adverbs) are usually stressed. However, grammar words (auxiliary verbs, pronouns, conjunctions, prepositions, etc.) are not. Because they have no stress, they are weakened when we speak.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Content words are stressed and pronounced in their full form - \u201cstrong form\u201d as opposed to grammar words that are pronounced in their \u201cweak form\u201d.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Weak forms are common in questions with auxiliary verbs. They are sometimes a bit difficult to hear properly.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Does</span> anyone want something to drink? (\u201cdoes\u201d is almost not pronounced while \u201canyone\u201d is stronger)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Do</span> you remember when the event is? (\u201cDo\u201d and \u201cyou\u201d are both weak and sound like \u201cdya\u201d)", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class=\"underline\">Do</span> you have time to talk about the event? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "When <span class=\"underline\">does</span> the event begin? ", "type": "example"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"content": "logistics", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the arrangements necessary in order to organize something successfully, especially something involving a lot of people", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Is this a meeting regarding logistics? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04aud01", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "These are words you use when planning an event. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"content": "commercial disaster", "type": "name"}, {"content": "an event or product that was a failure", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: That PR event was a commercial disaster.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04aud02", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "forthcoming ", "type": "name"}, {"content": "happening or coming soon", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(adjective)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: I'm confident our forthcoming event will be more organized.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04aud03", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "to direct attention to", "type": "name"}, {"content": "to focus your concern on someone or something", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(expression)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: We should direct attention to our product. ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04aud04", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "clout", "type": "name"}, {"content": "the authority to make decisions or the power to influence events", "type": "definition"}, {"content": "(noun)", "type": "part_speech"}, {"content": "Example: Do you have enough clout to argue for a celebrity hosting our show? ", "type": "example"}, {"content": "engenn7le14ob04aud05", "type": "audio"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"content": "You are going to plan an event at your workplace. ", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Go online and do some research on how to plan an event and what to include.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Discuss your event plans with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Your partner will ask questions about the date, the music, the time, etc.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Respond politely to all questions. ", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_extension"}, {"contents": [{"content": "I research information on event planning.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I share my event ideas with a partner.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "I respond to questions politely.", "type": "text"}], "type": "takeaway_assessment"}], "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "_data": [], "id": 0, "type": "welcome"}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "title": "", "type": "audio", "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "engenn7le14ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "0", "id": 0, "text": ""}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob04re2img05.jpg", "time": "100", "id": 1, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Does this meeting concern logistics?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Yes and no. Why don't we start with a date and a venue?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: That's a good start. Do you have a date in mind?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: I regret to inform you that we don't. When does Sao Paulo fashion week begin?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Four Fridays from today. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Rocco</span>: I'm afraid that's too soon. Do you remember Anthropology's scheduled PR event?"}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob04re2img06.jpg", "time": "23000", "id": 2, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: That was a commercial disaster. I'm confident our forthcoming event will be more organized. So we have a date. Should we decide upon a time? <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Certainly. There's a one hour difference between Sao Paulo and Boston. If we want to direct attention to our product, we should start at 7 p.m. here and 6 p.m. in Boston. What do you say?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It's definitely a great idea.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: There's also a slot at 9 p.m."}, {"image": "engenn7le14ob04re2img07.jpg", "time": "51000", "id": 3, "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: No, thanks. 6 p.m. is great. Ferdinand, do you have enough clout to argue for a celebrity hosting our show?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: Not sure, but I'll do my best. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Now: a venue. What's a good location for a band, fashion show and reception?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Ferdinand</span>: How about the train station hall? There's plenty of space there. <br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Perfect. I'll look into the venue this afternoon."}], "audiosrc": "engenn7le14ob04re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le14ob04re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"contents": [{"content": " I can pronounce weak forms in questions.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can respond politely to suggestions and offers.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about jobs and work.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " What kind of events are usually hosted by your company?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What things do you need to keep in mind when planning one?", "type": "Free Header Item"}], "type": "instructions"}, {"contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}], "type": "group"}, {"content": {"attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}], "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "allowed_attempts": 2}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": "Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": "Pronunciation Spot: Let's plan an event!  ", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "img_path": "", "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {